    "de": [
      "Förderung der verschiedenen Musikensembles der gemeindeübergreifenden Musikschule von Livron und Loriol, darunter der Erwachsenenchor Cappuccino Forte und der Kinderchor Coro Piccolo."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Promote the various musical ensembles of the Livron and Loriol intercommunal music school, including the adult choir Cappuccino Forte and the children's choir Coro Piccolo."
    ],
